repository-code: "https://github.com/MIR-1-WSP/model-intervention-records"
keywords:
  - weight-space programming
  - model intervention records
  - conformance testing
  - evaluation validity
  - reproducibility
  - model editing
notes: >-
  Published under a collective identity. The specification text, the companions,
  and the paper are CC BY 4.0; the code is Apache-2.0. The document version is
  1.0 and is independent of the test-suite version, which is reported by the
  validator's first line.
